I mean, you have to help
that people have hope.

00:39:11.038 --> 00:39:15.621
I mean, without hope, you give up, don't
you, if you hope for a better future.

00:39:16.079 --> 00:39:18.454
So maybe for whatever jobs being lost,

00:39:18.454 --> 00:39:21.996
